    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1697850/extras/b670a17cb394f26bdca816c219f1fb96.poster.avif?t=1745902627\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1697850/extras/b670a17cb394f26bdca816c219f1fb96.webm?t=1745902627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1697850/extras/b670a17cb394f26bdca816c219f1fb96.mp4?t=1745902627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Claim your bounty</h2>Engage in a tense, lightning fast combat; Use mobility, skill and whim to overcome fearsome Underwest barons and their servants. Master weapon abilities to get out of any tricky situation.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1697850/extras/85e781db321dae726e14d1b16028a62a.poster.avif?t=1745902627\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1697850/extras/85e781db321dae726e14d1b16028a62a.webm?t=1745902627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unique Graphic Novel aesthetic</h2>Traverse meticulously designed world of the Underwest, depicted in breathtaking, hand drawn animation. Jump through numerous panels, inspired by the works of Genndy Tartakovsky (Samurai Jack, Primal)<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1697850/extras/4b4d677a549dcb4c2fcb9c7a2dd665af.poster.avif?t=1745902627\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1697850/extras/4b4d677a549dcb4c2fcb9c7a2dd665af.webm?t=1745902627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1697850/extras/4b4d677a549dcb4c2fcb9c7a2dd665af.mp4?t=1745902627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore the Wild West Underworld</h2>Venture a variety of spirit realms, full of mystery and despair. Uncover Underwest\u2019s many secrets and search for the truth.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1697850/extras/5bd275d3faf91ac8d95cbe7a417ec8bb.poster.avif?t=1745902627\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1697850/extras/5bd275d3faf91ac8d95cbe7a417ec8bb.webm?t=1745902627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1697850/extras/5bd275d3faf91ac8d95cbe7a417ec8bb.mp4?t=1745902627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Grand story of loss and devotion</h2>Experience the story of Rose who\u2019s been blackmailed by an evil Spirit of the Underworld. Follow her odyssey through the dangerous Underwest to free her daughter's spirit, imprisoned in a silver locket.",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1697850/extras/b670a17cb394f26bdca816c219f1fb96.poster.avif?t=1745902627\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1697850/extras/b670a17cb394f26bdca816c219f1fb96.webm?t=1745902627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1697850/extras/b670a17cb394f26bdca816c219f1fb96.mp4?t=1745902627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Claim your bounty</h2>Engage in a tense, lightning fast combat; Use mobility, skill and whim to overcome fearsome Underwest barons and their servants. Master weapon abilities to get out of any tricky situation.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1697850/extras/85e781db321dae726e14d1b16028a62a.poster.avif?t=1745902627\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1697850/extras/85e781db321dae726e14d1b16028a62a.webm?t=1745902627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unique Graphic Novel aesthetic</h2>Traverse meticulously designed world of the Underwest, depicted in breathtaking, hand drawn animation. Jump through numerous panels, inspired by the works of Genndy Tartakovsky (Samurai Jack, Primal)<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1697850/extras/4b4d677a549dcb4c2fcb9c7a2dd665af.poster.avif?t=1745902627\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1697850/extras/4b4d677a549dcb4c2fcb9c7a2dd665af.webm?t=1745902627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><